  m_Name: S5Cevap2001
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  etiket: dogc
  aciklama:
  - "Demek 2001 y\u0131l\u0131...\r\nO y\u0131l Microsoft, Windows XP'yi piyasaya
    s\xFCrm\xFC\u015Ft\xFC. Biraz olsun rahat nefes ald\u0131k... Sen hangi i\u015Fletim
    sistemini kullan\u0131yorsun?"
  - "2001 y\u0131l\u0131 \xF6yle mi?\r\nO y\u0131l rahmetli Michael Jackson, Invincible
    alb\xFCm\xFCn\xFC \xE7\u0131karm\u0131\u015Ft\u0131. \u015Eu adam\u0131n vefat\u0131na
    her seferinde \xFCz\xFCl\xFCyorum... "
  - "2001 y\u0131l\u0131 m\u0131?\r\n\u0130stanbul Sabiha G\xF6k\xE7en Uluslararas\u0131
    Havaliman\u0131 o y\u0131l hizmete girmi\u015Fti. Fly me to the moon!... U\xE7may\u0131
    sever misin? E u\xE7akla git?..."
  - "2001 mi?\r\nWikipedia o y\u0131l kurulmu\u015Ftu. \u0130\xE7indeki bilgilerin
    do\u011Frulu\u011Fu tart\u0131\u015F\u0131l\u0131r; fakat g\xFCzel sitedir. Sen
    kullan\u0131yor musun?"
  - "2001 ha?\r\n21. y\xFCzy\u0131l\u0131n ve 3. milenyum'un bu y\u0131lla birlikte
    ba\u015Flad\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131 biliyor muydun? Milenyum \xE7ocu\u011Fu
    seni..."
  aranacakEtiket: konum izin
